# Homework 3 - AI Fairness and Bias Detection

This assignment uses the `loan_dataset.xlsx` dataset to evaluate fairness in loan approval outcomes across protected demographic groups.

## Objectives
- Analyze loan approval outcomes across protected demographic groups
- Evaluate fairness using metrics such as:
  - Disparate Impact (DI)
  - Statistical Parity Difference (SPD)
  - Equalized Odds
- Use fairness libraries such as AIF360 or Fairlearn
- Compare outcomes across demographic groups including gender and race
- Identify potential bias in the dataset
- Interpret the fairness results and provide conclusions

## Files
- Jupyter Notebook containing the fairness analysis
- `loan_dataset.xlsx`
